{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019SsjQos15KSJRvMbhzYjuz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current Performance Summary\n\n| Component | Baseline APC 300 | Current APC 300 | Baseline APC 0 | Current APC 0 | APC 0→300 scaling |\n|-----------|-----------------|-----------------|----------------|---------------|-------------------|\n| **STARK excl trace** | **2455ms** | **1129ms (2.17x)** | **2153ms** | **1791ms (1.20x)** | **1.59x** |\n| LogUp GKR | 790ms | 383ms | 993ms | 709ms | 1.85x |\n| Round 0 | 662ms | 181ms | 178ms | 178ms | 0.98x |\n| MLE Rounds | 180ms | 161ms | 118ms | 118ms | 0.73x |\n| Trace Commit | 406ms | 197ms | 518ms | 476ms | 2.42x |\n| WHIR | 100ms | 128ms | 220ms | 218ms | 1.70x |\n| Stacked Reduction | 311ms | 75ms | 113ms | 78ms | 1.04x |\n\n**Target: >2x scaling (APC 300 ≤ 895ms). Gap: 234ms.**\n\n## Analysis of Non-Scaling Components\n\nComponents that **don't scale** and limit the APC 0→300 ratio:\n1. **Round 0 (181ms)**: Floor set by large AIRs common to both configs. Multi-stream already applied (8 threads). No scaling because same large AIRs dominate.\n2. **MLE Rounds (161ms)**: Actually **anti-scales** (worse at APC 300). More traces (623 vs 99) increase per-round work despite smaller per-trace data.  \n3. **Stacked Reduction (75ms)**: ~36ms CPU NTT + ~39ms GPU kernels. Doesn't scale.\n\n## Optimization Ideas\n\nNow let me detail, estimate, and rank ideas based on extensive code and profiling analysis.\n\n**Idea 1: Accumulate constant contributions of fully-folded (height-1) traces in MLE rounds**\n- At APC 300, many traces reach height-1 early (round 3-7 of 14). Currently, per-round monomial kernels process ALL height-1 traces every round.\n- Pre-accumulate constant contributions when traces become height-1, skip per-trace processing in later rounds.\n- **Expected impact**: 25-35ms at APC 300, <5ms at APC 0\n- **Probability**: Medium (60%) — need to correctly compute constant contributions  \n- **Complexity**: Moderate — changes to sumcheck_polys_batch_eval categorization logic\n\n**Idea 2: GPU-side polynomial reconstruction for Stacked Reduction Round 0**\n- Replace CPU NTT-based `reconstruct_s0_from_g` with a GPU kernel that does the polynomial multiplication on-device, eliminating D2H sync + CPU compute.\n- **Expected impact**: 15-20ms at APC 300, similar at APC 0\n- **Probability**: High (75%) — straightforward NTT on GPU\n- **Complexity**: Moderate — new CUDA kernel + FFI\n\n**Idea 3: Fix batch Round 0 kernel hang and enable sub-batch dispatch for small AIRs**\n- Diagnose the >12 AIR hang in the batch Round 0 kernel (committed infrastructure from task 2026-04-13-1600). Fix bug, then batch 300+ small AIRs in groups of 12.\n- **Expected impact**: 30-50ms at APC 300, no change at APC 0\n- **Probability**: Low (30%) — 3 previous attempts failed, kernel bug undiagnosed\n- **Complexity**: High — CUDA kernel debugging + orchestration\n\n**Idea 4: Optimize large-AIR Round 0 kernel execution**\n- The zerocheck_ntt_evaluate_constraints_kernel for large AIRs (height > 2^16) takes ~5ms per AIR. Profile and optimize register usage, shared memory, NTT steps.\n- **Expected impact**: 20-40ms at APC 300 if kernel speeds up 20-30%\n- **Probability**: Low-Medium (35%) — already extensively optimized\n- **Complexity**: High — CUDA kernel micro-optimization\n\n**Idea 5: Reduce precompute_logup_combinations kernel overhead at APC 300**\n- 55ms total (1582 launches). Batch by merging GLOBAL and SCATTER launches, or pre-compute for rounds where trace state doesn't change.\n- **Expected impact**: 15-25ms at APC 300, <5ms at APC 0\n- **Probability**: Medium (50%)\n- **Complexity**: Moderate\n\n## Ranking (impact × probability / complexity)\n\n| Idea | Score | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| 1. Accumulate height-1 traces | **High** | Best scaling improvement, APC 300-specific |\n| 2. GPU Stacked Reduction reconstruction | Medium | Reliable but equal savings at both configs |\n| 5. Reduce precompute_combinations | Medium | Moderate impact, APC 300-specific |\n| 3. Fix batch Round 0 | Low | Highest potential but lowest probability |\n| 4. Optimize large-AIR kernel | Low | High complexity, uncertain gains |\n\n**Selected: Idea 1 — Accumulate constant contributions of fully-folded traces in MLE rounds**\n\nNow let me write the task and plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8396,"cache_read_input_tokens":168520,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8396},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97df75af-c1b3-4850-8566-f6b18608e3d5","uuid":"57579b41-b402-4d47-8035-c54e78524fa3"}
