{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GzLpcMxcG7uPVBHUd7TzoN","type":"tool_result","content":"autoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:5:Eliminate GPU monomial evaluation kernel launches for \"dead\" (height-1) traces in MLE sumcheck rounds by caching per-monomial matrix-value products once and recomputing the weighted sum on CPU each round. At APC 300, this targets ~35-41ms of GPU time across `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` (17ms, 178 instances), `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel` (18ms, 43 instances), and `logup_monomial_kernel` (6ms, 356 instances).\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:15:2. **Late logup evaluation** (lines 1880-1900): Build `LogupMonomialBatch` from late traces with interactions → launch `logup_monomial_kernel` on GPU → D2H results → store in `self.logup_tilde_evals[trace_idx]`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:17:3. **Late zerocheck evaluation** (lines 1901-1919): Build `ZerocheckMonomialBatch` from late traces with constraints → launch `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` on GPU → D2H results → store in `self.zerocheck_tilde_evals[trace_idx]`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:33:- `LogupMonomialBatch::evaluate()` → launches `logup_monomial_kernel` on GPU, reads matrix values from device, evaluates interaction polynomial. File: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/monomial.rs`\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:34:- `ZerocheckMonomialBatch::evaluate()` → launches `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` / `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel` on GPU, reads matrix values and lambda_combs from device. File: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/monomial.rs`\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:89:But the `logup_monomial_kernel` computes: `result = sum over interactions of (logup_comb[i] * interaction_eval[i])`, where `logup_comb[i]` changes per round.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0200-cache-monomial-products-for-dead-traces/plan.md:141:5. Profile with nsight: verify `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` and `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel` instance counts decrease significantly (from 178+43 to ~30-50, only newly-late traces)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2200-prealloc-round0-threshold-buffers/plan.md:69:    pub zerocheck_monomials: Option<ZerocheckMonomials>,\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/report.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/report.md:13:1. **`warp_zerocheck_monomial_kernel`**: Warp-per-trace zerocheck evaluation. 4 warps per block (128 threads). Each warp handles one trace; thread lane = y_int. Active lanes loop over ALL monomials serially, apply eq_xi, then warp_reduce_sum. Lane 0 writes directly to scattered output position.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/report.md:15:2. **`warp_logup_monomial_kernel`**: Same pattern for logup, evaluating both numerator and denominator monomials per trace. Two warp_reduce_sum calls (numer + denom). Adds bus_term_sum contribution per y_int.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/report.md:19:4. **C launchers**: `_warp_zerocheck_monomial_batched`, `_warp_logup_monomial_batched`, `_scatter_fpext_blocks`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/report.md:56:**Root cause**: The `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` itself accounts for only ~17ms of the 158ms MLE Rounds total (from nsight profiling). Even a hypothetical 100% elimination of kernel time would save at most 17ms. The warp kernel doesn't eliminate computation — it reorganizes it. The actual savings come from:\nautoopt-results/task.md:3:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:14:- **late_eval** traces (round > n_lift, effectively num_y=1): handled by `ZerocheckMonomialBatch` with `evaluate(1)` (line 1876) → launches `zerocheck_monomial_kernel`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:15:- **low_early** traces (num_y ≤ monomial_num_y_threshold=512): handled by `ZerocheckMonomialBatch` with `evaluate(num_x)` (line 1876) → launches `zerocheck_monomial_kernel`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:16:- **high_mono_traces** (num_y > 512, low monomial ratio): `ZerocheckMonomialParYBatch` → launches `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:21:At APC 300 with 623 small AIR instances: the vast majority have num_y ≤ 512 in early rounds, and ALL traces transition to late_eval (num_y=1) as MLE rounds progress. The `zerocheck_monomial_kernel` and `LogupMonomialBatch` handle most of the work.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:23:### zerocheck_monomial_kernel (`batch_mle_monomial.cu:102–151`)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:47:nsight profile: `zerocheck_monomial_kernel`: 178 instances, 17ms total, 0.09ms avg.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:59:Add `warp_zerocheck_monomial_kernel`:\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:65:__global__ void warp_zerocheck_monomial_kernel(\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:122:Add C launcher `_warp_zerocheck_monomial_batched`:\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:130:Add `warp_logup_monomial_kernel` — same warp-per-trace pattern, but accumulates both `numer_sum` and `denom_sum` (FracExt output). Two `warp_reduce_sum` calls (no `__syncthreads` needed — single warp).\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:132:The logup monomial kernel (`logup_monomial_kernel`, `batch_mle_monomial.cu`) iterates over interactions and evaluates numerator/denominator expressions. The warp kernel maintains the same logic but with each thread covering one y-value and looping over interactions.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:134:Add C launcher `_warp_logup_monomial_batched`.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:141:- `warp_zerocheck_monomial_batched(output, air_ctxs, trace_ids, num_traces, num_x) -> Result`\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:142:- `warp_logup_monomial_batched(output, logup_air_ctxs, trace_ids, num_traces, num_x) -> Result`\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-2130-warp-per-trace-mle-eval/plan.md:160:    let nm = pk.per_air[t.air_idx].other_data.zerocheck_monomials\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 30]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J7wTUwCB4kx1fVvip9Z9LN","session_id":"97df75af-c1b3-4850-8566-f6b18608e3d5","uuid":"8cfbc277-4ff0-4e24-9c34-d4551752c83e","timestamp":"2026-04-16T00:04:05.248Z"}
