{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ni1yH8jMgYa3yFT66HcrfT","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cpu-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs-55-\ncrates/cpu-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs:56:    // scaling_factor = (r^N - 1) / N  where N = 2^l_skip, shift = 1\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cpu-backend/src/stacked_reduction.rs-57-    let r_pow_n = r.exp_power_of_2(l_skip);\n--\ncrates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs-58-/ For the hyperprism D_n evaluation, the rows for point `x` are:\ncrates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs:59:///   row[(x << l_skip) + z + offset] for z = 0..2^l_skip\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs-60-/// where offset=1 for rotation, 0 otherwise.\n--\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs-312-///\ncrates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs:313:/// The zerofier `(shift*z)^(2^l_skip) - 1 = shift^(2^l_skip) - 1` is\ncrates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs:314:/// constant per coset (since z^(2^l_skip) = 1 for z in D_{l_skip}),\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cpu-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs-315-/// so we precompute zerofier_inv per coset.\n--\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs-138-    for _ in 0..10 {\ncrates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs:139:        let l_skip = rng.random_range(1usize..=2);\ncrates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs:140:        let n_stack = rng.random_range(8usize..=9);\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs-141-        let k_whir = rng.random_range(1usize..=4);\n--\n/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs-259-\ncrates/backend-tests/src/lib.rs:260:    let n_stack = 8;\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 20]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0192Qvd465i9XpeWnmukTiDV","session_id":"97df75af-c1b3-4850-8566-f6b18608e3d5","uuid":"63fb3f08-6a1b-40ff-8358-4a5c5947ccba","timestamp":"2026-04-16T00:15:39.454Z"}
